 "meta": {
  "id": "7477490c915e1e29505354d37e43371f",
  "name": {
   "zh": "图像对位 · RoMa v2",
   "en": "Image Alignment · RoMa v2"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "稠密特征匹配要估计同一个三维场景两张画面之间的全部对应关系；RoMa v2 用新的匹配架构和损失，精度明显超过前几代。这张卡把参考图对齐到画面上，按「匹配」看对齐图盖到画面上的效果，交付一套多层 EXR（对齐后的参考图 aligned、ST 贴图、置信度）和两边的匹配点。",
   "en": "Dense feature matching estimates all correspondences between two images of the same 3D scene; RoMa v2 uses a new matching architecture and loss and is clearly more accurate than earlier generations. This card aligns the reference image to the image; Match shows the aligned image over the image, and it delivers a multi-layer EXR (the aligned reference image, ST map, confidence) and the matches on both sides."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T09:00:00",
  "deliverable": "align",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
